Ryan Hefferan wrote:
> I have heard rumots of being able to convert any altar to your gods altar or
> at least to a coaligned altar..is thier any trruth to the rumour? if so, how
> do i do it?

Sacrifice a corpse on the altar. Only do this if your alignment is
positive or you may be converted instead. Probability of success is
(XL+2)/(XL+8) where X is your current experience level (so a level one
character has a 1/3 chance of successful conversion and a level ten
character has a 2/3 chance).

Same race sacrifice as a chaotic always successfully converts.

Unsuccessful attempts will lower your luck by one and abuse wisdom.
Successful attempts will raise your luck by one, exercise wisdom and
anger any attendant priest. Neither will anger your god although
characters of at least level seven may summon a hostile minion.

Do not try to convert unaligned altars (Moloch altars).

